{"at":"2026-02-27T23:28:29.779Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":691,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/realease-notes-and-roadmap/new-features-roadmap/","title":"New Features & Roadmap","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>New Features &amp; Roadmap</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"12378\" class=\"elementor elementor-12378\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de29a61 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"de29a61\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c36379b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c36379b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We are dedicated to providing our members with the latest technology and innovative tools to make searching, sharing, and selling simpler and more efficient.</p><p><strong>If you have suggestions, please explore the <a href=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/request-new-features/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request New Features page</a> to upvote ideas or add your own if it’s not already listed.</strong></p><p>Below, you’ll find a Roadmap of our latest and upcoming features and updates:</p><p><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><h2><strong><u>Milestones met:</u></strong></h2><div><strong><u><br></u></strong></div><p><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">28th January 2025 </span>✅<em><br></em></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MLS Soft Launch Date to Pioneers</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">12th February 2025 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong>✅</strong></span><em><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><br></strong></span></em>MLS Launch Date to WhatsApp Groups with 2,500+ estate agents &amp; Public Release.</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">1st April 2025</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\">✅</span><br></strong>New Feature:&nbsp; Short-Term Rentals Launch</p><p><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">20th January 2026</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span></strong><em><br></em>New Feature: <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/ai-ezd_ampersand-automation/ai-property-research-agent/\">AI Property Report Agent</a></p><p><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">16th February 2026</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span></strong><em style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></em><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">New Feature:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/marketing-and-promotion/feature-your-property-on-the-public-property-portal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Public Portal</a><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Launch</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><u>Milestones to come:</u></strong></h2><div><strong><u><br></u></strong></div><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">1st March 2026</span></strong><em><br></em>New Feature: <a href=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/new-developments/\">New Developments</a>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">8th April 2025</span></strong><em style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></em><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">New Feature:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/requests/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">ReQuests</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"doc-btm\">\n\t\t    </div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"New Features & Roadmap • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}